00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:44.340
What?
什么？

445
00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.580
Good Lord, Keanu is beautiful.
天哪，基努真是太帅了。

446
00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:47.640
Yeah, he's beautiful.
是啊，他很帅。

447
00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:48.500
Beautiful.
帅极了。

448
00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.340
He's beautiful.
他真的很帅。

449
00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:50.100
You know what I wrote?
你知道我写了什么吗？

450
00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:50.460
