Yeah.
是啊。

975
00:39:26.910 --> 00:39:28.370
There's a full glass of water.
有一满杯水。

976
00:39:28.750 --> 00:39:31.430
Well, I know what pill Dwight would take.
好吧，我知道德怀特会选哪颗药丸。

977
00:39:31.630 --> 00:39:32.130
You do?
你知道？

978
00:39:32.130 --> 00:39:32.830
I do.
我知道。

979
00:39:33.030 --> 00:39:35.850
Here is what I teased at the top of our breakdown.
这就是我在节目开头预告的内容。

980
00:39:36.110 --> 00:39:41.990
When we were revisiting the finale for our rewatch, I found a few pictures of a warehouse
当我们重温大结局时，我发现了几张仓库的照片，

981
00:39:41.990 --> 00:39:47.170
set up to look like this very scene with the leather distressed chairs and the coffee table.
布置得就像这一幕一样，有做旧的皮椅和咖啡桌。

982
00:39:47.330 --> 00:39:50.970
And there sitting in the room were Hank and Dwight.
坐在房间里的是汉克和德怀特。

983
00:39:51.290 --> 00:39:52.150
They were photographed.
他们被拍了下来。

984
00:39:52.150 --> 00:39:53.970
There was an on-set photographer.
当时有现场摄影师。

985
00:39:54.310 --> 00:39:56.970
These pictures I found on the NBC website.
这些照片是我在NBC官网上找到的。

986
00:39:57.150 --> 00:39:59.490
Did they immediately look like the Matrix?
他们看起来一眼就像《黑客帝国》吗？

987
00:39:59.750 --> 00:40:01.190
Were you like, what's going on?
你当时在想，这是怎么回事？

988
00:40:01.270 --> 00:40:02.190
This looks like the Matrix?
这看起来像《黑客帝国》吗？

989
00:40:02.250 --> 00:40:03.670
Oh, it's 100% the Matrix.
哦，百分之百是《黑客帝国》。

990
00:40:04.030 --> 00:40:08.230
So I remember going to the deleted scenes for the finale, and they weren't in there.
所以我记得去看了大结局的删减片段，里面没有这一段。

991
00:40:08.370 --> 00:40:09.710
And I saved these pictures.
于是我保存了这些照片。

992
00:40:10.030 --> 00:40:14.410
And when we decided to rewatch the Matrix, I reached out to Dave Rogers, and I sent him
当我们决定重温《黑客帝国》时，我联系了戴夫·罗杰斯，发给了他

993
00:40:14.410 --> 00:40:15.030
one of the pictures.
其中一张照片。

994
00:40:15.190 --> 00:40:16.390
And I was like, what is this about?
我问他，这是怎么回事？

995
00:40:16.630 --> 00:40:18.190
Like, they're not in deleted scenes.
删减片段里没有这一段。

996
00:40:18.470 --> 00:40:20.450
I'm trying to find it in a shooting draft.
我试着在拍摄剧本草稿里找它。

997
00:40:20.450 --> 00:40:23.850
And he said, actually, this was a cold open that we shot.
他说，其实这是我们拍过的一个开场戏。

998
00:40:24.090 --> 00:40:28.770
And then I found it in the very first table draft script, lady.
然后我在第一版剧本草稿里找到了它，女士。

999
00:40:28.970 --> 00:40:30.070
And I read it.
我读了它。

1000
00:40:30.170 --> 00:40:34.850
And not only am I going to read you the setup for the scene, I'm also going to play part
不仅我要为你读这段戏的背景设定，我还要播放一部分

1001
00:40:34.850 --> 00:40:35.490
of it for you.
为你准备的。

1002
00:40:35.610 --> 00:40:36.550
I love this.
我喜欢这个。

1003
00:40:36.850 --> 00:40:38.630
Interior Dwight's office morning.
内景，德怀特的办公室，早晨。

1004
00:40:38.970 --> 00:40:40.350
Dwight works all business.
德怀特正全神贯注地工作。

1005
00:40:40.590 --> 00:40:44.270
He glances out to the bullpen and sees a black cat run by his door.
他瞥了一眼办公区，看到一只黑猫从他门口跑过。

1006
00:40:44.610 --> 00:40:47.090
Dwight registers this as odd, but lets it go.
德怀特觉得这有点奇怪，但没太在意。

1007
00:40:47.090 --> 00:40:51.290
A beat later, the same cat crosses the same exact way.
过了一会儿，同一只猫又以完全相同的方式跑过。

1008
00:40:51.650 --> 00:40:52.850
Dwight leans back.
德怀特向后靠在椅背上。

1009
00:40:53.070 --> 00:40:54.090
He seems shaken.
他看起来有些动摇。

1010
00:40:54.510 --> 00:40:56.230
Jim and Pam, joint talking head.
吉姆和帕姆，联合采访。

1011
00:40:56.550 --> 00:40:58.430
Jim, what's the cat about?
吉姆，那只猫是怎么回事？

1012
00:40:58.670 --> 00:40:59.370
Fair question.
问得好。

1013
00:40:59.810 --> 00:41:02.230
The last few months, Dwight's been running things well.
过去几个月，德怀特把事情处理得很好。

1014
00:41:02.430 --> 00:41:03.510
Business is booming.
生意蒸蒸日上。

1015
00:41:03.770 --> 00:41:04.650
All is good.
一切都很顺利。

1016
00:41:04.950 --> 00:41:08.810
Then a little voice inside me said, Jim, what about the pranks?
然后我内心有个小声音说，吉姆，恶作剧呢？

1017
00:41:09.230 --> 00:41:12.690
And then Jim goes on to share maybe one last big one.
接着吉姆开始分享他可能策划的最后一个大型恶作剧。

1018
00:41:12.810 --> 00:41:18.190
And Pam says, that's when we knew somehow he had to get Dwight into the matrix.
帕姆说，就在那时我们知道，无论如何都得把德怀特拉进《黑客帝国》的世界里。

1019
00:41:18.590 --> 00:41:19.610
Oh my gosh.
天哪。

1020
00:41:19.790 --> 00:41:21.530
This is a huge Jim prank.
这是一个超大的吉姆式恶作剧。

1021
00:41:21.810 --> 00:41:24.130
Huge Jim prank that Pam is in on.
帕姆也参与其中的超大吉姆式恶作剧。

1022
00:41:24.390 --> 00:41:27.970
Pam, we find out, learns to train the cats to do this move.
我们发现，帕姆学会了训练猫咪做这个动作。

1023
00:41:28.450 --> 00:41:32.610
Jim does a whole bunch of stuff on Dwight's computer, kind of like the way Trinity reached
吉姆在德怀特的电脑上做了很多操作，就像崔妮蒂联系他那样。

1024
00:41:32.610 --> 00:41:33.230
out to him.
联系他。

1025
00:41:33.370 --> 00:41:35.290
This is a very long cold open.
这是一个非常长的开场戏。

1026
00:41:35.470 --> 00:41:36.970
It's like five minutes long.
足足有五分钟长。

1027
00:41:36.970 --> 00:41:39.530
Dave Rogers said he's actually going to put it back in.
戴夫·罗杰斯说他实际上要把这段加回去。

1028
00:41:39.690 --> 00:41:42.230
It's going to be in the super fan version of the finale.
它会出现在大结局的超级粉丝版里。

1029
00:41:42.470 --> 00:41:43.910
Oh, that's so fun.
噢，那太有趣了。

1030
00:41:44.110 --> 00:41:44.670
I know.
我知道。

1031
00:41:44.690 --> 00:41:47.990
But for now, part of it does live online.
但目前，其中一部分确实在网上流传。

1032
00:41:48.270 --> 00:41:49.730
I found it on YouTube.
我在YouTube上找到了。

1033
00:41:49.890 --> 00:41:56.970
And I just want you to hear the moment they have convinced Dwight that the matrix is real
我只是想让你听听他们说服德怀特相信《黑客帝国》是真实存在的时刻，

1034
00:41:56.970 --> 00:42:00.670
and he's gone to meet Hank, who's playing, well, you'll hear.
他去见汉克，汉克扮演的是……嗯，你听了就知道了。

1035
00:42:02.460 --> 00:42:02.980
Hello?
喂？

1036
00:42:03.460 --> 00:42:06.680
Meet me in the warehouse, but watch out for the men in reception.
到仓库来见我，但要小心接待处的人。

1037
00:42:07.380 --> 00:42:08.380
There's no men.
那里没有人。

1038
00:42:08.520 --> 00:42:09.360
It was...
那是……

1039
00:42:30.030 --> 00:42:34.910
That is the name I allowed you to know me by while I watched over you, waiting for the
那是我让你称呼我的名字，当时我正守护着你，等待着

1040
00:42:34.910 --> 00:42:35.890
time to approach.
时机成熟。

1041
00:42:36.350 --> 00:42:37.750
That time has come.
时机已经到了。

1042
00:42:38.550 --> 00:42:41.290
And now, you may know my real name.
现在，你可以知道我的真名了。

1043
00:42:42.330 --> 00:42:42.890
Dorpheus.
多菲斯（Dorpheus）。

1044
00:42:43.510 --> 00:42:44.070
Dorpheus?
多菲斯？

1045
00:42:44.070 --> 00:42:45.830
I'm Morpheus' brother.
我是墨菲斯的兄弟。

1046
00:42:49.220 --> 00:42:54.790
The Matrix isn't real.
《黑客帝国》不是真实的。

1047
00:42:55.070 --> 00:43:00.230
It's a trilogy of flawless, life-changing films and an online game.
它是一部由三部完美、改变人生的电影和一款网络游戏组成的系列作品。

1048
00:43:00.530 --> 00:43:06.510
The first Matrix movie was a program written by my team to prepare people for the truth.
第一部《黑客帝国》电影是我团队编写的一个程序，旨在让人们为真相做好准备。

1049
00:43:06.690 --> 00:43:11.370
But then the machines countered with their own program to make it seem as if a peace was
但随后机器进行了反击，它们编写了自己的程序，让人们以为和平已经

1050
00:43:11.370 --> 00:43:11.930
achieved.
实现了。

1051
00:43:12.130 --> 00:43:15.190
So, there is no peace?
所以，没有和平了吗？

1052
00:43:15.350 --> 00:43:16.350
There is not.
没有。

1053
00:43:16.730 --> 00:43:18.210
Oh, that is terrible news.
噢，那真是个糟糕的消息。

1054
00:43:18.210 --> 00:43:19.490
Dwight, we need your help.
德怀特，我们需要你的帮助。

1055
00:43:19.750 --> 00:43:26.430
I would like you to join my underground army and help us wage war for the freedom of all
我想请你加入我的地下军队，帮助我们为全人类的自由而战。

1056
00:43:26.430 --> 00:43:27.230
humankind.
人类。

1057
00:43:28.150 --> 00:43:29.530
Hank is good on his feet.
汉克临场反应很快。

1058
00:43:29.730 --> 00:43:29.910
Right?
对吧？

1059
00:43:30.110 --> 00:43:31.250
I told you he'd nail it.
我就说他能搞定吧。

1060
00:43:34.450 --> 00:43:38.230
If you take the blue pill, you will stay in the Matrix.
如果你吃下蓝色药丸，你就会留在矩阵里。

1061
00:43:38.630 --> 00:43:40.630
You will remember none of this.
你将不会记得这一切。

1062
00:43:40.970 --> 00:43:42.790
Life will go on as it is for you.
你的生活将一如既往地继续。

1063
00:43:43.830 --> 00:43:51.810
If you take the red pill, I will open your eyes and you will see just how deep the rabbit
如果你吃下红色药丸，我会让你大开眼界，让你见识到兔子洞到底有多深。

1064
00:43:51.810 --> 00:43:52.610
hole goes.
深。

1065
00:43:56.250 --> 00:43:57.530
I'll take the blue pill.
我要吃蓝色药丸。

1066
00:43:58.490 --> 00:44:02.510
Wait, now the blue will keep you in the program.
等等，蓝色药丸会让你留在程序里。

1067
00:44:02.870 --> 00:44:04.250
The red's the cool one.
红色药丸才是酷的那个。

1068
00:44:04.350 --> 00:44:04.850
I understand.
我明白。

1069
00:44:04.850 --> 00:44:05.930
I'd like the blue pill, please.
我想要蓝色药丸，谢谢。

1070
00:44:06.610 --> 00:44:07.930
Well, maybe I didn't explain myself.
好吧，也许我没解释清楚。

1071
00:44:07.930 --> 00:44:09.650
Dorothy, you were very clear.
多萝西，你解释得很清楚。

1072
00:44:09.850 --> 00:44:15.530
It's just, God, you know, I really appreciate the work that you and your brother are doing.
只是，天哪，你知道，我真的很感激你和你兄弟所做的工作。

1073
00:44:16.090 --> 00:44:20.090
I appreciate it's too small a word, but the timing is terrible right now.
“感激”这个词太轻了，但现在时机真的很糟糕。

1074
00:44:20.310 --> 00:44:21.730
They just promoted me to manager.
他们刚提拔我做经理。

1075
00:44:22.090 --> 00:44:23.450
Plus, I own this building.
而且，这栋楼是我的。

1076
00:44:23.450 --> 00:44:24.950
I run a very substantial farm.
我还经营着一个规模很大的农场。

1077
00:44:25.110 --> 00:44:28.570
And I'm getting married soon to a woman I love.
而且我很快就要和我爱的女人结婚了。

1078
00:44:28.930 --> 00:44:34.390
And okay, yeah, maybe that love is just zeros and ones, but I don't want to lose it.
好吧，也许那份爱只是由0和1组成的，但我不想失去它。

1079
00:44:35.330 --> 00:44:40.990
But no one hates machines more than me, but I'm happy.
虽然没人比我更痛恨机器，但我现在很幸福。

1080
00:44:42.170 --> 00:44:43.810
I'm truly happy.
我是真心感到幸福。

1081
00:44:44.650 --> 00:44:45.010
Aw.
噢。

1082
00:44:45.510 --> 00:44:46.830
Are you kidding me?
你在开玩笑吗？

1083
00:44:46.930 --> 00:44:48.290
I hired 30 people.
我雇了30个人。

1084
00:44:49.150 --> 00:44:50.590
The blue pill.
蓝色药丸。

1085
00:44:50.590 --> 00:44:52.250
I did not see that coming.
我没料到会这样。

1086
00:44:52.370 --> 00:44:53.010
I know.
我知道。

1087
00:44:53.410 --> 00:44:56.610
Dwight takes the blue pill because he wants to stay happy.
德怀特选择了蓝色药丸，因为他想保持幸福。

1088
00:44:56.610 --> 00:44:58.030
He loves his life.
他热爱他的生活。

1089
00:44:58.390 --> 00:45:02.130
And, you know, you can hear Jim and Pam because they're watching it like on a monitor.
而且，你知道，你可以听到吉姆和帕姆的声音，因为他们正在监视器前看着这一切。

1090
00:45:02.350 --> 00:45:02.570
Yeah.
是啊。

1091
00:45:02.570 --> 00:45:05.450
But yeah, it was an elaborate prank.
但确实，这是一个精心设计的恶作剧。

1092
00:45:05.630 --> 00:45:08.510
I mean, I don't know how much money Jim spent on that one.
我是说，我不知道吉姆在那上面花了多少钱。

1093
00:45:09.250 --> 00:45:10.130
Oh, yeah.
噢，确实。

1094
00:45:10.430 --> 00:45:10.790
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1095
00:45:11.290 --> 00:45:12.930
He hired 30 people.
他雇了30个人。

1096
00:45:13.050 --> 00:45:13.710
30 people.
30个人。

1097
00:45:14.010 --> 00:45:14.870
So there you go.
所以就是这样。

1098
00:45:15.010 --> 00:45:17.250
A little The Office, The Matrix crossover.
《办公室》和《黑客帝国》的一次小联动。

1099
00:45:17.750 --> 00:45:19.010
Well, I love that lady.
嗯，我爱那位女士。

1100
00:45:19.430 --> 00:45:20.630
Why don't we take a break?
我们休息一下好吗？

1101
00:45:21.070 --> 00:45:24.330
And when we come back, we'll talk about which pill Neo chose.
稍后回来，我们将讨论尼奥选择了哪颗药丸。

1102
00:45:24.710 --> 00:45:24.930
Yeah.
没错。

1103
00:45:35.080 --> 00:45:36.300
Everyone, we are back.
各位，我们回来了。

1104
00:45:36.440 --> 00:45:37.040
And guess what?
你猜怎么着？

1105
00:45:37.940 --> 00:45:39.680
Neo takes the red pill.
尼奥选了红色药丸。

1106
00:45:39.680 --> 00:45:40.360
Yeah.
没错。

1107
00:45:40.640 --> 00:45:46.400
And then Morpheus takes him into this sort of back room that's got a lot of computers and gadgets and stuff.
然后墨菲斯把他带进了一个类似后室的地方，里面有很多电脑、小玩意儿之类的东西。

1108
00:45:46.400 --> 00:45:51.520
Yeah, they hook him up to, like, it seems like an EKG kind of a machine.
对，他们把他连上了一台看起来像心电图机的设备。

1109
00:45:51.880 --> 00:46:01.300
They're going to have to keep an eye on his vital signs because as this virtual world starts to break down in front of his eyes, like, literally, like,
他们必须密切监测他的生命体征，因为当这个虚拟世界在他眼前开始崩塌时，真的是字面意义上的崩塌，就像是，

1110
00:46:01.360 --> 00:46:03.980
the mirror becomes all gummy that he's looking at.
他照的那面镜子变得像胶水一样黏糊。

1111
00:46:03.980 --> 00:46:09.240
They need to make sure that he doesn't, like, freak himself out so much that he, like, goes into shock or something.
他们得确保他不会因为过度惊吓而休克之类的。

1112
00:46:09.440 --> 00:46:09.500
Yeah, exactly.
没错，正是如此。

1113
00:46:09.500 --> 00:46:10.360
And his heart stops.
导致心脏骤停。

1114
00:46:10.620 --> 00:46:14.240
Well, Morpheus says, look, the pill you took is part of a tracing program.
墨菲斯说，听着，你服下的药丸是追踪程序的一部分。

1115
00:46:14.640 --> 00:46:21.880
It's designed to disrupt your input-output carrier signals so they can pinpoint his location in the pod field.
它旨在干扰你的输入输出载波信号，这样他们就能精确定位他在培养皿阵列中的位置。

1116
00:46:22.700 --> 00:46:23.800
The pod field.
培养皿阵列。

1117
00:46:23.880 --> 00:46:24.220
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1118
00:46:24.220 --> 00:46:26.800
Yeah, because that's where he really is.
没错，因为那才是他真实所在的地方。

1119
00:46:26.840 --> 00:46:31.560
And we're going to see him wake up in this pod of goo.
我们将看到他在那个充满黏液的培养皿中醒来。

1120
00:46:31.740 --> 00:46:34.760
Of goo with all these tubes and—
充满黏液，还有所有那些管子，然后——

1121
00:46:34.760 --> 00:46:35.660
He's naked.
他是赤身裸体的。

1122
00:46:35.900 --> 00:46:36.560
He's naked.
他没穿衣服。

1123
00:46:36.880 --> 00:46:38.180
This scene is so amazing.
这一幕太震撼了。

1124
00:46:38.460 --> 00:46:41.000
It's something I still think about, like, this scene.
我至今还会想起这一幕。

1125
00:46:41.300 --> 00:46:41.720
Yeah.
没错。

1126
00:46:41.720 --> 00:46:52.140
I mean, this big mechanical bug comes over, and it starts to, like, choke him, but then it starts—all the tubes that are attached to him start popping off.
我是说，那个巨大的机械虫爬过来，开始勒住他，然后所有的管子都开始脱落。

1127
00:46:52.300 --> 00:46:52.980
Oh, baby.
噢，天哪。

1128
00:46:53.200 --> 00:46:56.980
And listen, I know that I said I wasn't going to look stuff up, but I looked this up.
听着，我知道我说过不会去查资料，但我还是查了。

1129
00:46:57.080 --> 00:46:59.580
Me too, because the scene is just bonkers.
我也是，因为这一幕简直太疯狂了。

1130
00:46:59.740 --> 00:47:00.500
It's so cool.
太酷了。

1131
00:47:00.720 --> 00:47:05.540
Did you watch the YouTube video about how they did this scene?
你看过关于他们如何拍摄这一幕的 YouTube 视频吗？

1132
00:47:05.540 --> 00:47:06.900
Did we watch the same thing?
我们看的是同一个吗？

1133
00:47:06.920 --> 00:47:07.600
I think we did.
我想是的。

1134
00:47:07.720 --> 00:47:08.700
With the water slide?
就是那个水滑梯的视频？

1135
00:47:08.880 --> 00:47:09.880
They built a slide.
他们真的造了一个滑梯。

1136
00:47:09.880 --> 00:47:13.900
I just want to share what a phenomenal physical actor Keanu is.
我只是想说基努是一位多么了不起的肢体表演演员。

1137
00:47:13.980 --> 00:47:15.040
Oh, yeah, that's him in the pod.
噢，没错，那就是他在培养皿里的样子。

1138
00:47:15.220 --> 00:47:16.120
That's him in the pod.
那就是他在培养皿里。

1139
00:47:16.480 --> 00:47:19.620
That spider thing that detaches him didn't exiSt.
那个把他解开的蜘蛛状东西根本不存在。

1140
00:47:19.840 --> 00:47:23.240
Was it—there wasn't even, like, a thing with tennis balls on it.
甚至连个贴着网球的道具都没有。

1141
00:47:23.360 --> 00:47:23.540
Yeah.
没错。

1142
00:47:23.780 --> 00:47:26.100
There was nothing grabbing his neck at all.
根本没有任何东西抓着他的脖子。

1143
00:47:26.200 --> 00:47:30.320
He just is reacting, like, they're calling out different things for him.
他只是在做出反应，就像有人在旁边指挥他一样。

1144
00:47:30.400 --> 00:47:31.800
He's reacting to nothing.
他是在对着空气演戏。

1145
00:47:32.120 --> 00:47:32.240
Yeah.
没错。

1146
00:47:32.360 --> 00:47:35.400
Even so much so, like, when he grabs, like, around his neck.
甚至当他伸手去抓脖子周围的时候也是。

1147
00:47:35.580 --> 00:47:35.700
Yeah.
没错。

1148
00:47:35.720 --> 00:47:37.400
When it claws around his neck.
当那个东西抓着他脖子的时候。

1149
00:47:37.520 --> 00:47:38.460
Yeah, that's what I was saying.
对，我刚才说的就是这个。

1150
00:47:38.460 --> 00:47:39.540
He's grabbing nothing.
他抓的什么都没有。

1151
00:47:39.880 --> 00:47:44.480
And the whole time he's in this pod and they're doing different takes, there's someone with
在他待在那个舱里拍摄不同镜头的时候，一直有人拿着

1152
00:47:44.480 --> 00:47:48.760
a bucket, a literal bucket of clear goo that they're dumping on him.
一个桶，真的是一桶透明的黏液，往他身上倒。

1153
00:47:48.900 --> 00:47:50.820
Yeah, they're just slopping the goo back on.
没错，他们就是把黏液重新泼回去。

1154
00:47:51.040 --> 00:47:57.680
Did you read that Keanu shaved his entire body, including his eyebrows, and lost 15 pounds
你读过那篇报道吗？说基努为了电影的这个部分，剃光了全身的毛，

1155
00:47:57.680 --> 00:47:59.260
for this part of the movie?
包括眉毛，还瘦了15磅？

1156
00:47:59.440 --> 00:48:00.260
Yes, I did.
是的，我读过。

1157
00:48:00.940 --> 00:48:01.860
That's crazy.
太疯狂了。

1158
00:48:02.120 --> 00:48:06.000
And that this scene concluded principal photography for the movie.
而且这一幕还是电影主体拍摄的杀青戏。

1159
00:48:06.180 --> 00:48:07.160
Well, that makes sense.
嗯，这倒说得通。

1160
00:48:07.160 --> 00:48:09.260
Yeah, because he had to shave his body.
是啊，因为他得把全身毛剃光。

1161
00:48:09.480 --> 00:48:09.800
Yeah.
没错。

1162
00:48:10.160 --> 00:48:13.140
And he really went down the tube into the water.
而且他真的是顺着管道滑进水里的。

1163
00:48:13.380 --> 00:48:14.580
They made this whole water slide.
他们专门造了整个滑水道。

1164
00:48:14.620 --> 00:48:18.280
And when I was watching it, I was like, wait, two people come out the bottom.
我当时看的时候就在想，等等，怎么底部出来的是两个人。

1165
00:48:18.540 --> 00:48:21.620
Keanu and then a guy with a camera, I think.
我想是基努，还有个扛着摄像机的人。

1166
00:48:21.860 --> 00:48:26.160
Like, there was a cameraman who went down the slide with him, which is crazy.
就是说，有个摄影师跟他一起滑了下来，这太疯狂了。

1167
00:48:26.340 --> 00:48:26.780
Amazing.
太厉害了。

1168
00:48:26.780 --> 00:48:29.060
I mean, how was your day at work, babe?
我是说，宝贝，你今天上班怎么样？

1169
00:48:29.340 --> 00:48:31.420
I went down a goo slide.
我滑了一次黏液滑梯。

1170
00:48:31.720 --> 00:48:33.060
So here's the thing.
所以重点是这样的。

1171
00:48:33.280 --> 00:48:35.100
There's all this physicality happening.
这里面有各种身体上的动作戏。

1172
00:48:35.440 --> 00:48:42.200
But at the same time, there's also this real realization as he looks over the edge and he
但与此同时，当他看向边缘，看到一个又一个的舱体时，

1173
00:48:42.200 --> 00:48:45.320
sees pod after pod after pod.
他也产生了一种真实的认知。

1174
00:48:45.520 --> 00:48:47.780
And these machines kind of tending to them.
还有那些机器在照料它们。

1175
00:48:47.980 --> 00:48:49.560
There's little tiny spider ones.
有那种小小的蜘蛛状机器。

1176
00:48:49.720 --> 00:48:50.720
There's the big ones.
还有大的那种。

1177
00:48:50.900 --> 00:48:51.160
Yeah.
没错。

1178
00:48:51.160 --> 00:48:55.060
It's like a whole system of machines harvesting humans.
这就像是一整套收割人类的机器系统。

1179
00:48:55.880 --> 00:49:00.260
And I found this really great account called The Art of Storytelling.
我发现了一个很棒的账号，叫“讲故事的艺术”。

1180
00:49:00.780 --> 00:49:02.600
And he sums up this moment.
他总结了这一刻。

1181
00:49:02.600 --> 00:49:04.000
And I want to share it with you.
我想和你分享一下。

1182
00:49:04.340 --> 00:49:04.580
Okay.
好啊。

1183
00:49:04.580 --> 00:49:12.540
Quote, so in the span of two and a half minutes, we've witnessed the birth of a prophet, a nightmarish
引用一下：在短短两分半钟内，我们见证了一位先知的诞生，一幅人类自我毁灭的噩梦般

1184
00:49:12.540 --> 00:49:18.860
vision of man's self-destruction, and a fragile hope for the salvation of humanity, all without
图景，以及拯救人类的脆弱希望，全程没有

1185
00:49:18.860 --> 00:49:25.160
a single word of dialogue, relying only on the artistry and ingenuity of production designers,
一句对白，完全依靠制作设计师、视觉特效师、音乐家、音效设计师、剪辑师的艺术造诣和独创性，

1186
00:49:25.680 --> 00:49:30.860
VFX artists, musicians, sound designers, editors, and of course, the incredible dedication
当然，还有基努·里维斯令人难以置信的敬业精神。

1187
00:49:30.860 --> 00:49:32.080
of Keanu Reeves.
如果这一幕不是通过电影媒介感染观众的大师级示范，

1188
00:49:32.080 --> 00:49:37.820
If this scene isn't a masterclass in how to affect an audience using the medium of cinema,
那我不知道什么才是了。

1189
00:49:38.040 --> 00:49:38.920
I don't know what is.
简直绝了。

1190
00:49:39.180 --> 00:49:39.700
Mic drop.
话筒落地（意指精彩绝伦）。

1191
00:49:39.920 --> 00:49:42.540
Great YouTube summary of the scene I'll share in our stories.
关于这一幕的YouTube精彩总结，我会分享到我们的快拍里。

1192
00:49:42.980 --> 00:49:46.260
Well, now Neo is brought aboard a ship.
好了，现在尼奥被带上了一艘飞船。

1193
00:49:46.520 --> 00:49:47.860
This is the real world.
这就是现实世界。

1194
00:49:48.000 --> 00:49:50.180
He's greeted by Morpheus and Trinity.
墨菲斯和崔妮蒂迎接了他。

1195
00:49:50.520 --> 00:49:52.360
And, you know, he's like, am I dead?
你知道，他当时问，我是死了吗？

1196
00:49:52.560 --> 00:49:53.800
And they're like, you're not dead.
他们回答说，你没死。

1197
00:49:54.080 --> 00:49:54.480
Yeah.
没错。

1198
00:49:54.680 --> 00:49:57.960
The ship is the Nebuchadnezzar, which means protect my air.
这艘船叫“尼布甲尼撒号”，意思是“保护我的空气”。

1199
00:49:58.140 --> 00:49:58.540
Okay.
好吧。

1200
00:49:58.980 --> 00:49:59.640
How about that?
怎么样？

1201
00:49:59.720 --> 00:50:01.720
He has to get strong.
他必须变得强壮起来。

1202
00:50:02.080 --> 00:50:04.300
He's going to get so much acupuncture.
他得接受大量的针灸治疗。

1203
00:50:04.500 --> 00:50:08.540
You've never seen someone with so much acupuncture in your life.
你这辈子都没见过谁扎过这么多针。

1204
00:50:08.680 --> 00:50:09.880
They're rebuilding his muscles.
他们正在重塑他的肌肉。

1205
00:50:10.040 --> 00:50:10.720
They've atrophied.
他的肌肉已经萎缩了。

1206
00:50:10.880 --> 00:50:12.420
I've been getting acupuncture, lady.
女士，我一直在做针灸。

1207
00:50:12.660 --> 00:50:14.040
You really love it.
你真的很喜欢它。

1208
00:50:14.120 --> 00:50:14.740
You should share.
你应该分享一下。

1209
00:50:15.060 --> 00:50:15.440
For my hot flashes.
为了缓解我的潮热。

1210
00:50:15.920 --> 00:50:21.740
Okay, because I'm taking tamoxifen for my breast cancer treatment, and a big side effect is hot flashes.
好吧，因为我正在服用他莫昔芬来治疗乳腺癌，而它的一大副作用就是潮热。

1211
00:50:21.740 --> 00:50:23.920
And I can't take anything for them.
而且我什么药都不能吃。

1212
00:50:24.060 --> 00:50:27.820
When you go into menopause, you can do, like, hormone replacement therapy.
当你进入更年期时，你可以进行激素替代疗法之类的治疗。

1213
00:50:27.820 --> 00:50:28.780
I can't.
但我不能。

1214
00:50:28.880 --> 00:50:34.500
The whole point of the medicine I'm taking is to unreplace my hormones, right?
我服用的药物的核心目的就是抑制激素，对吧？

1215
00:50:34.580 --> 00:50:36.080
To suppress my estrogen.
为了抑制我的雌激素。

1216
00:50:36.380 --> 00:50:40.360
So I am white-knuckling my way through this, and the hot flashes are so bad.
所以我只能咬牙硬撑，那种潮热感太难受了。

1217
00:50:40.500 --> 00:50:44.920
And I started going to acupuncture, and I love it.
后来我开始做针灸，我爱死它了。

1218
00:50:44.920 --> 00:50:46.660
You said they've, like, stopped.
你说它们已经，呃，停止了？

1219
00:50:46.840 --> 00:50:47.980
They have stopped.
它们确实停止了。

1220
00:50:48.380 --> 00:50:48.860
Stopped.
停止了。

1221
00:50:48.880 --> 00:50:49.320
That's crazy.
太不可思议了。

1222
00:50:49.320 --> 00:50:53.640
I used to wake up four to five times a night completely drenched.
我以前每晚要醒来四五次，浑身都被汗湿透了。

1223
00:50:53.940 --> 00:50:55.360
So I'm sitting there.
所以我坐在那儿。

1224
00:50:55.460 --> 00:51:00.660
I'm watching Neo with his 25,000 acupuncture needles, and I'm thinking,
看着尼奥身上插着两万五千根针，我在想，

1225
00:51:00.800 --> 00:51:02.620
Neo, you're going to be great.
尼奥，你会好起来的。

1226
00:51:02.820 --> 00:51:04.360
This is going to work out for you.
这招对你一定管用。

1227
00:51:04.500 --> 00:51:05.220
Trust me.
相信我。

1228
00:51:05.220 --> 00:51:05.600
Trust me.
相信我。

1229
00:51:05.900 --> 00:51:07.380
And you're not going to have hot flashes.
而且你以后再也不会有潮热了。

1230
00:51:07.520 --> 00:51:08.660
He's not going to have any.
他绝对不会再有了。

1231
00:51:08.840 --> 00:51:10.900
He does say, why do my eyes hurt?
他确实问过，为什么我的眼睛会痛？

1232
00:51:11.040 --> 00:51:13.000
Because they've never seen anything before.
因为它们以前从未见过任何东西。

1233
00:51:13.000 --> 00:51:14.840
Morpheus says you've never used them before.
墨菲斯说是因为你以前从没用过它们。

1234
00:51:15.000 --> 00:51:15.220
Yeah.
没错。

1235
00:51:15.440 --> 00:51:16.580
How crazy is that?
这有多疯狂？

1236
00:51:16.720 --> 00:51:17.200
I know.
我知道。

1237
00:51:17.520 --> 00:51:20.840
So now some time has passed, and Neo is going to wake up.
时间过去了一些，尼奥快要醒了。

1238
00:51:20.980 --> 00:51:21.700
He's dressed.
他穿好了衣服。

1239
00:51:22.140 --> 00:51:24.440
He's on a cot of some sort.
他躺在某种行军床上。

1240
00:51:24.620 --> 00:51:26.720
And I have to say something here.
我在这里必须得说点什么。

1241
00:51:26.900 --> 00:51:27.120
Okay.
好吧。

1242
00:51:27.340 --> 00:51:32.060
So they can create so many things in this world.
他们在这个世界里能创造出那么多东西。

1243
00:51:32.300 --> 00:51:33.300
Is it about his wardrobe?
你是想说他的衣服吗？

1244
00:51:33.540 --> 00:51:35.680
Why can't they make a sweater without a hole in it?
为什么他们就不能做一件没有破洞的毛衣呢？

1245
00:51:36.180 --> 00:51:36.840
I think.
我是这么想的。

1246
00:51:36.920 --> 00:51:37.100
Why?
为什么？

1247
00:51:37.120 --> 00:51:42.300
I said, why does everyone have, like, an old pair of long johns,
我说，为什么每个人都穿着那种旧秋衣，

1248
00:51:42.300 --> 00:51:45.640
like, kind of waffle-y, long sleeve, and they all have holes?
就是那种华夫格纹理的长袖，而且全都有破洞？

1249
00:51:45.840 --> 00:51:48.180
This was my big complaint about The Last of Us.
这是我对《最后生还者》最大的不满。

1250
00:51:48.440 --> 00:51:51.300
This was very hard for me on The Last of Us.
看《最后生还者》的时候，这一点让我非常难受。

1251
00:51:51.400 --> 00:51:56.000
I understand that the virus, you know, took over,
我明白病毒，你知道，已经蔓延开来，

1252
00:51:56.040 --> 00:51:59.200
and we've had to sort of, like, live behind walls
我们不得不，怎么说呢，生活在围墙后面，

1253
00:51:59.200 --> 00:52:00.860
in these little makeshift communities.
住在这些临时搭建的社区里。

1254
00:52:00.860 --> 00:52:05.840
But did we lose our ability to sweep a floor or dust a shelf?
但我们难道连扫地或掸灰尘的能力都丧失了吗？

1255
00:52:05.840 --> 00:52:11.360
But, by the way, we have made matching outfits for people in the government
顺便说一下，我们还为政府里的人制作了配套的制服，

1256
00:52:11.360 --> 00:52:12.220
and our new government.
还有我们新政府的制服。

1257
00:52:12.220 --> 00:52:14.360
And we've made new currency.
我们还发行了新货币。

1258
00:52:14.360 --> 00:52:15.060
Okay, okay.
行吧，行吧。

1259
00:52:15.160 --> 00:52:17.000
And all kinds of badges and things.
还有各种各样的徽章之类的东西。

1260
00:52:17.100 --> 00:52:17.380
Where?
在哪？

1261
00:52:17.520 --> 00:52:18.720
Where are we making those?
我们在哪制作这些东西的？

1262
00:52:18.900 --> 00:52:22.200
And yet, in the place that we're living all the time,
然而，在我们一直居住的地方，

1263
00:52:22.340 --> 00:52:23.760
no one swept a floor.
却没人扫过地。

1264
00:52:24.180 --> 00:52:25.000
I didn't get it.
我不明白。

1265
00:52:25.160 --> 00:52:25.740
Like, why?
就是说，为什么？

1266
00:52:25.960 --> 00:52:27.440
Everything was—it was so dirty.
所有地方都——太脏了。

1267
00:52:27.700 --> 00:52:28.200
No, I know.
不，我知道。

1268
00:52:28.300 --> 00:52:29.000
You know what I'm saying?
你明白我的意思吗？

1269
00:52:29.000 --> 00:52:30.940
And, by the way, we're going to get to the food.
顺便提一下，我们待会儿会谈到食物。

1270
00:52:31.040 --> 00:52:32.920
I have the same complaint about the food.
我对食物也有同样的抱怨。

1271
00:52:33.060 --> 00:52:34.120
There's no sun.
这里没有阳光。

1272
00:52:35.840 --> 00:52:38.500
We have access, I think, to animals, right?
我想我们应该能接触到动物，对吧？

1273
00:52:38.720 --> 00:52:39.340
Okay, maybe.
好吧，也许吧。

1274
00:52:39.500 --> 00:52:41.360
We don't know because we haven't seen Zion.
我们不知道，因为我们还没见过锡安。

1275
00:52:41.660 --> 00:52:42.000
Right.
没错。

1276
00:52:42.160 --> 00:52:42.820
We don't know what's there.
我们不知道那里有什么。

1277
00:52:43.020 --> 00:52:46.480
Zion's in the middle of the earth where it's still warm, a little bit warm.
锡安位于地心，那里依然温暖，稍微有点暖和。

1278
00:52:46.640 --> 00:52:46.840
Yeah.
是啊。

1279
00:52:47.060 --> 00:52:49.940
So, maybe they do have to recycle their clothes.
所以，也许他们确实得循环利用衣服。

1280
00:52:50.120 --> 00:52:52.080
From back in yield and times.
从旧时代遗留下来的那些。

1281
00:52:52.080 --> 00:52:52.860
Maybe so.
也许吧。

1282
00:52:53.460 --> 00:52:54.420
But still.
但即便如此。

1283
00:52:54.840 --> 00:52:55.320
Well—
嗯——

1284
00:52:55.320 --> 00:52:57.540
We can't darn a hole in a sweater.
我们连毛衣上的破洞都补不好。

1285
00:52:57.560 --> 00:52:58.800
Maybe we could sew.
也许我们本可以缝补的。

1286
00:52:59.460 --> 00:53:00.300
That's what I mean.
我就是这个意思。

1287
00:53:00.360 --> 00:53:04.820
We can't take our patches of fabric that we have left
我们不能把剩下的布料拼凑起来，

1288
00:53:04.820 --> 00:53:06.560
and turn it into something better.
改造成更好的东西吗？

1289
00:53:06.640 --> 00:53:09.600
We've lost our ability to sew.
我们已经丧失了缝纫的能力。

1290
00:53:09.740 --> 00:53:13.040
We do learn from Morpheus that this real world,
我们从墨菲斯那里得知，这个现实世界，

1291
00:53:13.160 --> 00:53:15.100
they're sort of in the desert of what's left.
他们算是处在废墟荒原之中。

1292
00:53:15.200 --> 00:53:16.520
It's very drab.
这里非常单调。

1293
00:53:16.580 --> 00:53:17.140
It's dark.
这里很黑暗。

1294
00:53:17.340 --> 00:53:17.900
It's dreary.
这里很凄凉。

1295
00:53:18.300 --> 00:53:20.680
They only have bits and pieces of information.
他们掌握的信息支离破碎。

1296
00:53:20.940 --> 00:53:22.200
But from what they can tell,
但据他们所知，

1297
00:53:22.340 --> 00:53:24.080
it looks like they gave birth to AI.
看起来是他们创造了人工智能。

1298
00:53:24.500 --> 00:53:26.860
Neo's like, AI, you mean artificial intelligence.
尼奥说，人工智能，你是说Artificial Intelligence。

1299
00:53:27.140 --> 00:53:29.260
Lady, this movie came out 26 years ago.
大姐，这部电影是26年前上映的。

1300
00:53:29.380 --> 00:53:30.500
Lady, I wrote,
大姐，我写道，

1301
00:53:30.500 --> 00:53:34.440
holy sh** balls, this AI storyline is even more frightening.
天哪，这个人工智能的故事线简直太可怕了。

1302
00:53:34.660 --> 00:53:34.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1303
00:53:35.220 --> 00:53:36.660
When I listen to this speech.
当我听这段演讲的时候。

1304
00:53:36.840 --> 00:53:39.440
Because here we are, and it's just the topic of everything.
因为我们现在所处的环境，这简直是所有话题的核心。

1305
00:53:39.820 --> 00:53:41.480
Like, AI is everywhere now.
就像，现在到处都是人工智能。

1306
00:53:41.680 --> 00:53:42.020
Yes.
没错。

1307
00:53:42.140 --> 00:53:45.200
Morpheus explains that we created AI,
墨菲斯解释说，是我们创造了人工智能，

1308
00:53:45.280 --> 00:53:47.580
and then AI got so smart, it took over.
然后人工智能变得太聪明了，以至于接管了一切。

1309
00:53:47.760 --> 00:53:50.460
There was a big battle between humans and machines.
人类和机器之间发生了一场大战。

1310
00:53:50.800 --> 00:53:51.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1311
00:53:51.200 --> 00:53:55.520
And at the time, humans thought the AI was dependent on solar power,
当时，人类认为人工智能依赖太阳能，

1312
00:53:55.840 --> 00:53:58.940
so they scorched the sun.
所以他们烧焦了太阳。

1313
00:53:59.280 --> 00:53:59.840
Basically.
基本上是这样。

1314
00:53:59.840 --> 00:54:02.220
Basically, but as it turns out,
基本上是这样，但事实证明，

1315
00:54:02.460 --> 00:54:04.660
fate, he says, is not without a sense of irony
他说，命运总是充满讽刺意味，

1316
00:54:04.660 --> 00:54:09.040
because they figured out how to have energy by using humans,
因为它们找到了利用人类获取能量的方法，

1317
00:54:09.280 --> 00:54:10.340
like human batteries.
就像把人类当成电池一样。

1318
00:54:10.740 --> 00:54:10.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1319
00:54:11.300 --> 00:54:15.340
Human beings are the batteries that now keep the machines alive.
人类现在成了维持机器生存的电池。

1320
00:54:15.800 --> 00:54:21.460
I thought this was ironic because our AI actually needs to be cooled down.
我觉得这很讽刺，因为我们的人工智能实际上需要降温。

1321
00:54:21.620 --> 00:54:22.580
With a lot of water.
需要大量的水。

1322
00:54:22.780 --> 00:54:23.000
Yeah.
是啊。

1323
00:54:23.440 --> 00:54:25.600
So, like, how do we power it?
那么，我们该怎么给它供电呢？

1324
00:54:25.680 --> 00:54:26.280
I don't know.
我不知道。

1325
00:54:26.540 --> 00:54:27.080
I don't know.
我不知道。

1326
00:54:27.080 --> 00:54:28.660
I just know we have to cool it down all the time.
我只知道我们必须一直给它降温。

1327
00:54:28.660 --> 00:54:31.000
We cool it down, and in the process, our planet's warming up.
我们给它降温，在这个过程中，我们的星球正在变暖。

1328
00:54:31.140 --> 00:54:31.360
Yeah.
是啊。

1329
00:54:31.500 --> 00:54:33.280
And we're wasting our water on it.
而且我们还在上面浪费水资源。

1330
00:54:33.400 --> 00:54:34.580
There's a lot we don't know.
有很多事情我们都不知道。

1331
00:54:34.580 --> 00:54:35.340
A lot we don't know.
有很多我们不知道的事。

1332
00:54:35.500 --> 00:54:38.360
I don't need my phone to summarize my text messages.
我不需要手机来帮我总结短信。

1333
00:54:38.720 --> 00:54:39.480
Is that AI?
那是人工智能吗？

1334
00:54:39.820 --> 00:54:40.260
Stop it.
别闹了。

1335
00:54:40.580 --> 00:54:40.880
Yeah.
是啊。

1336
00:54:40.880 --> 00:54:49.120
Every time I go to write a Word document now, it, like, begins with, like, asking me if I want AI to help me.
现在每次我写Word文档，它都会问我是否需要人工智能的帮助。

1337
00:54:49.240 --> 00:54:51.900
But, lady, I just saw this thing.
但是，大姐，我刚看到这个东西。

1338
00:54:52.180 --> 00:54:58.140
I'm going to read it since we're on the subject because I screen grabbed it because it, like, haunted me so.
既然我们聊到这个话题，我就读一下，因为我截了图，它简直让我魂牵梦绕。

1339
00:54:58.620 --> 00:54:59.920
And it's about AI.
是关于人工智能的。

1340
00:54:59.920 --> 00:55:05.480
Okay, they did a study of people who were using ChatGPT.
好的，他们对使用ChatGPT的人进行了一项研究。

1341
00:55:05.720 --> 00:55:06.200
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1342
00:55:06.540 --> 00:55:14.620
And they found that 83.3% of people using ChatGPT couldn't remember what they wrote minutes after they finished writing it.
他们发现，83.3%使用ChatGPT的人在写完几分钟后就记不住自己写了什么。

1343
00:55:14.860 --> 00:55:15.780
Of course not.
当然记不住了。

1344
00:55:16.200 --> 00:55:16.460
Yeah.
是啊。

1345
00:55:16.460 --> 00:55:26.400
Also, when researchers asked ChatGPT users to write without any AI help, they did worse than people who had never used AI before.
此外，当研究人员要求ChatGPT用户在没有任何人工智能帮助的情况下写作时，他们的表现比从未用过人工智能的人还要差。

1346
00:55:26.980 --> 00:55:37.280
So, in this control group, the people who used ChatGPT longer, it created a type of, like, dependency and cognitive atrophy.
所以，在这个对照组中，那些使用ChatGPT时间更长的人，产生了一种依赖性和认知萎缩。

1347
00:55:37.560 --> 00:55:37.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1348
00:55:37.980 --> 00:55:40.200
What does that look like for the long term of your brain?
这对你的大脑长期发展意味着什么？

1349
00:55:40.360 --> 00:55:42.840
Your brain is, like, literally like, oh, you don't need me?
你的大脑简直就像是在说，哦，你不需要我了吗？

1350
00:55:42.960 --> 00:55:44.100
I'm going to peace out.
那我就撤了。

1351
00:55:44.340 --> 00:55:45.180
Yeah, basically.
没错，基本上是这样。

1352
00:55:45.180 --> 00:55:51.340
Well, anyway, in this world, AI has, like, taken humans captive and are using us as batteries.
总之，在这个世界里，人工智能把人类囚禁起来，把我们当成电池使用。

1353
00:55:51.580 --> 00:55:52.620
This is how bad it can get.
情况就是这么糟糕。

1354
00:55:53.040 --> 00:55:54.160
Neo doesn't want to believe it.
尼奥不愿相信这一点。

1355
00:55:54.220 --> 00:55:55.280
He's like, it's not possible.
他觉得这不可能。

1356
00:55:55.560 --> 00:55:57.740
Morpheus is like, look, I didn't say it would be easy.
墨菲斯说，听着，我没说这会很容易。

1357
00:55:57.780 --> 00:55:59.340
I just said it would be the truth.
我只是说这是真相。

1358
00:55:59.620 --> 00:56:01.800
And then he sort of apologizes to Neo.
然后他向尼奥道了歉。

1359
00:56:01.960 --> 00:56:05.360
He's like, we never free a mind once it's reached a certain age.
他说，我们从不解救达到一定年龄的人的意识。

1360
00:56:05.520 --> 00:56:06.120
It's dangerous.
这很危险。

1361
00:56:06.360 --> 00:56:07.820
The mind has trouble letting go.
人的意识很难放下执念。

1362
00:56:08.100 --> 00:56:09.860
But I had to do it.
但我必须这么做。

1363
00:56:09.960 --> 00:56:13.620
I had to because you are the one.
我必须这么做，因为你就是那个救世主。

1364
00:56:13.960 --> 00:56:14.360
Yeah.
没错。

1365
00:56:14.360 --> 00:56:18.900
And we find out that there has been other, quote-unquote, ones.
我们还发现，以前有过其他的“救世主”。

1366
00:56:19.260 --> 00:56:25.180
There was a man born inside the Matrix, and he could change and remake the Matrix however he wanted.
有一个人出生在矩阵里，他可以随心所欲地改变和重塑矩阵。

1367
00:56:25.180 --> 00:56:26.420
And that man died.
后来那个人死了。

1368
00:56:26.500 --> 00:56:30.440
Because it was prophesied when that man died that he would return.
因为预言说，那个人死后会再次归来。

1369
00:56:30.640 --> 00:56:34.800
And Morpheus has spent his whole life looking for Neo.
墨菲斯一生都在寻找尼奥。

1370
00:56:34.800 --> 00:56:41.880
Yeah, because it is prophesied that Neo would bring on the destruction of the Matrix.
没错，因为预言说尼奥会摧毁矩阵。

1371
00:56:42.260 --> 00:56:44.760
So that's a lot for him to absorb.
这对尼奥来说信息量太大了。

1372
00:56:44.780 --> 00:56:46.000
And he goes to bed.
于是他去睡觉了。

1373
00:56:46.200 --> 00:56:47.740
The next day, we wake up.
第二天，我们醒了过来。

1374
00:56:48.000 --> 00:56:48.700
Tank's in his room.
坦克在房间里。

1375
00:56:48.780 --> 00:56:49.600
I love Tank.
我喜欢坦克。

1376
00:56:49.860 --> 00:56:50.220
Love.
超爱。

1377
00:56:50.400 --> 00:56:51.440
I love Tank.
我喜欢坦克。

1378
00:56:51.580 --> 00:56:53.460
He just lights up the screen.
他一出场就让屏幕亮了起来。

1379
00:56:53.780 --> 00:56:55.260
Oh, Marcus Chong plays Tank.
哦，马库斯·钟饰演坦克。

1380
00:56:55.480 --> 00:56:56.620
He just owns the scene.
他完全掌控了整个场景。

1381
00:56:56.780 --> 00:56:58.900
He's so excited to help Neo train.
他非常兴奋能帮尼奥训练。

1382
00:56:59.060 --> 00:57:00.320
He's going to be his operator.
他要担任他的操作员。

1383
00:57:00.320 --> 00:57:03.780
We learned that Tank and his brother Dozer, they're 100% homegrown.
我们了解到坦克和他的兄弟多泽是百分之百土生土长的。

1384
00:57:04.000 --> 00:57:06.880
Yeah, they don't have any, like, little spigots on them.
没错，他们身上没有任何那种小插口。

1385
00:57:06.960 --> 00:57:07.940
They have no spigots.
他们没有插口。

1386
00:57:08.180 --> 00:57:09.340
They've never been in a pod.
他们从未被关在培养皿里。

1387
00:57:09.540 --> 00:57:10.980
They are children of Zion.
他们是锡安的孩子。

1388
00:57:11.200 --> 00:57:11.920
I have a question.
我有个问题。

1389
00:57:12.040 --> 00:57:14.580
Do we ever see Zion in any of the sequels?
我们在续集里见过锡安吗？

1390
00:57:14.680 --> 00:57:15.300
Yes, we do.
见过，我们见过。

1391
00:57:15.300 --> 00:57:16.040
I can't remember.
我不记得了。

1392
00:57:16.280 --> 00:57:16.480
We do.
我们见过。

1393
00:57:16.600 --> 00:57:19.980
And people are happy and dancing, and they get it on.
人们在那里快乐地跳舞，还亲热。

1394
00:57:20.180 --> 00:57:21.120
Are there animals there?
那里有动物吗？

1395
00:57:21.280 --> 00:57:22.120
I don't remember animals.
我不记得有动物。

1396
00:57:22.120 --> 00:57:23.560
How are they dressed in Zion?
锡安的人穿什么衣服？

1397
00:57:23.720 --> 00:57:24.240
Are their clothes better?
他们的衣服更好看吗？

1398
00:57:24.240 --> 00:57:26.340
It's all, like, shades of beige.
全是那种米色系的。

1399
00:57:26.720 --> 00:57:26.940
Okay.
好吧。

1400
00:57:27.060 --> 00:57:28.420
Some not wearing a lot.
有些人穿得很少。

1401
00:57:28.740 --> 00:57:31.780
There is sort of like a rave at Zion and dance.
锡安那边好像在开狂欢派对，大家都在跳舞。

1402
00:57:32.100 --> 00:57:32.900
It is like—
就像是——

1403
00:57:32.900 --> 00:57:33.820
What movie is this?
这是什么电影？

1404
00:57:33.900 --> 00:57:34.840
Things are bumping.
气氛很嗨。

1405
00:57:34.960 --> 00:57:40.300
I have no doubt that Tank and Dozer are homegrown because I think people in Zion are—they're
我毫不怀疑坦克和杜泽是土生土长的，因为我觉得锡安的人们——他们

1406
00:57:40.300 --> 00:57:40.720
happy.
很开心。

1407
00:57:41.200 --> 00:57:41.540
Okay.
好吧。

1408
00:57:41.780 --> 00:57:43.220
They get it on, is all I'm going to say.
我只能说，他们很会享受生活。

1409
00:57:43.360 --> 00:57:47.480
Well, now Neo's training is going to begin, and this is the awesome part of this movie
好了，现在尼奥的训练要开始了，这是电影里最棒的部分，

1410
00:57:47.480 --> 00:57:50.940
where they can just upload knowledge right into his head.
他们可以直接把知识上传到他的大脑里。

1411
00:57:51.100 --> 00:57:53.980
He downloads stuff for 10 hours straight.
他连续下载了10个小时的东西。

1412
00:57:54.240 --> 00:57:54.660
Yeah.
是啊。

1413
00:57:54.920 --> 00:57:55.760
That's a long time.
那时间可真够长的。

1414
00:57:56.020 --> 00:57:58.440
There are many famous lines in this training scene.
这段训练场景里有很多经典台词。

1415
00:57:58.780 --> 00:58:00.940
Number one, I know kung fu.
第一句，我会功夫了。

1416
00:58:01.280 --> 00:58:01.560
Yes.
没错。

1417
00:58:01.920 --> 00:58:04.340
Next one, oh, this one's so good.
下一句，哦，这句太棒了。

1418
00:58:04.500 --> 00:58:07.940
When they're in the simulation, him and Morpheus are fighting in the dojo.
当他们在模拟程序里时，他和墨菲斯在道场打斗。

1419
00:58:08.140 --> 00:58:08.580
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

1420
00:58:08.860 --> 00:58:12.020
And he's kind of getting winded, Neo's winded, and Morpheus goes,
他有点喘不过气了，尼奥气喘吁吁的，然后墨菲斯说，

1421
00:58:12.180 --> 00:58:14.160
do you think that is air you're breathing?
你以为你呼吸的是空气吗？

1422
00:58:14.480 --> 00:58:16.180
Oh, I thought that was so good.
哦，我觉得那句太赞了。

1423
00:58:16.280 --> 00:58:16.440
Yeah.
是啊。

1424
00:58:17.020 --> 00:58:20.280
And then, of course, don't think you are, know you are.
当然还有那句，别以为你行，要相信你行。

1425
00:58:20.500 --> 00:58:22.020
You have to let it all go.
你必须放下一切执念。

1426
00:58:22.020 --> 00:58:25.620
So fear, doubt, and disbelief free your mind.
所以恐惧、怀疑和不信，要解放你的思想。

1427
00:58:25.820 --> 00:58:31.120
This sort of sequence between Morpheus and Neo is so freaking cool.
墨菲斯和尼奥之间的这段戏真是酷毙了。

1428
00:58:31.260 --> 00:58:32.040
It's really cool.
真的很酷。

1429
00:58:32.280 --> 00:58:36.720
I have to ask you if you could have stuff just, like, uploaded into your brain.
我得问问你，如果能把东西直接上传到你的大脑里，你会选什么？

1430
00:58:36.720 --> 00:58:38.580
I have that in my thing to ask you.
我正准备问你这个问题呢。

1431
00:58:38.720 --> 00:58:39.020
Okay.
好啊。

1432
00:58:39.300 --> 00:58:40.140
Do you have an answer?
你有答案了吗？

1433
00:58:40.600 --> 00:58:43.380
I was going to ask you when Trinity learns to fly the helicopter.
我本来想问你崔妮蒂是什么时候学会开直升机的。

1434
00:58:44.600 --> 00:58:47.820
Because when that happened, my daughter turned to me and goes,
因为当那一幕发生时，我女儿转过头对我说，

1435
00:58:47.980 --> 00:58:49.340
oh, that, now that is cool.
哦，那个，那个才叫酷。

1436
00:58:49.500 --> 00:58:51.360
Like, just like that, you can fly a helicopter.
就像那样，你就能开直升机了。

1437
00:58:51.800 --> 00:58:52.160
All right.
好吧。

1438
00:58:52.220 --> 00:58:54.840
I do, I mean, I think there'd be so many things.
我有，我是说，我觉得会有很多想学的东西。

1439
00:58:55.020 --> 00:59:00.300
But one of the things I would love is be able to speak any language anywhere.
但我最想要的一项能力是能随时随地讲任何语言。

1440
00:59:00.640 --> 00:59:00.760
Yeah.
是啊。

1441
00:59:01.300 --> 00:59:01.700
Instantaneously.
瞬间掌握。

1442
00:59:01.700 --> 00:59:03.080
That was my first thought.
我第一个想到的也是这个。

1443
00:59:03.260 --> 00:59:05.860
It was either language or musical instruments.
要么是语言，要么是乐器。

1444
00:59:06.380 --> 00:59:06.720
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

1445
00:59:06.900 --> 00:59:07.580
That's interesting.
真有意思。

1446
00:59:07.580 --> 00:59:08.520
We both have language.
我们俩都选了语言。

1447
00:59:09.220 --> 00:59:11.520
Sam, do you have anything you would want to upload immediately?
山姆，你有什么想立刻上传学习的东西吗？

1448
00:59:12.040 --> 00:59:13.660
Probably just learning other languages.
大概也是学习其他语言吧。

1449
00:59:13.960 --> 00:59:15.020
Oh, that's what we said.
哦，我们刚才说的就是这个。

1450
00:59:15.100 --> 00:59:15.300
Yeah.
是啊。

1451
00:59:15.520 --> 00:59:16.040
That's it.
就是这样。

1452
00:59:16.520 --> 00:59:16.960
Cassie?
凯西？

1453
00:59:17.160 --> 00:59:19.480
I mean, I feel like that's a great superpower.
我是说，我觉得那是个很棒的超能力。

1454
00:59:20.080 --> 00:59:22.480
Oh, I like this for us, you guys.
噢，伙计们，我喜欢这个设定。

1455
00:59:22.660 --> 00:59:23.700
We would all be able to talk.
我们都能交流了。

1456
00:59:23.700 --> 00:59:24.400
We could all travel.
我们都能去旅行了。

1457
00:59:24.620 --> 00:59:24.900
Yes.
没错。

1458
00:59:25.300 --> 00:59:31.020
Well, word gets out pretty quick on the ship that Morpheus and Neo are in this simulation
好吧，墨菲斯和尼奥在模拟程序里打斗的消息在船上传得很快，

1459
00:59:31.020 --> 00:59:32.820
fighting, and they all want to come watch.
大家都想来看。

1460
00:59:33.000 --> 00:59:37.140
They can't believe how fast, like, Neo's, like, brainwaves and stuff are moving.
他们简直不敢相信尼奥的脑电波之类的东西运转得有多快。

1461
00:59:38.240 --> 00:59:41.000
And Morpheus is like, okay, it's time for the jump.
然后墨菲斯说，好了，该进行跳跃训练了。

1462
00:59:41.220 --> 00:59:41.520
Yeah.
是啊。

1463
00:59:41.720 --> 00:59:47.300
This is the simulation where Neo is going to have to jump from one building to another
这就是尼奥必须从一栋楼跳到另一栋楼的模拟程序，

1464
00:59:47.300 --> 00:59:47.880
building.
楼。

1465
00:59:48.160 --> 00:59:51.380
Seems very quick in his training that they've already gone to the jump.
在训练中这么快就进行跳跃测试，感觉有点仓促。

1466
00:59:51.480 --> 00:59:55.460
And they're all like, no one ever makes the jump on the first time.
他们都说，从来没人第一次就能跳过去。

1467
00:59:55.560 --> 00:59:56.320
No one makes it.
没人能做到。

1468
00:59:56.460 --> 00:59:56.700
Yeah.
是啊。

1469
00:59:56.820 --> 00:59:58.260
And Neo does not make it.
结果尼奥没跳过去。

1470
00:59:58.340 --> 00:59:58.980
He doesn't.
他没做到。

1471
00:59:58.980 --> 01:00:03.160
And in fact, when they come back to the real world, he has, like, a little bit of blood
事实上，当他们回到现实世界时，他的嘴唇上有一点血迹，

1472
01:00:03.160 --> 01:00:05.480
on his lip, and he's confused by that.
他对此感到困惑。

1473
01:00:05.600 --> 01:00:07.980
He's like, I thought you said the simulation isn't real.
他说，我以为你说过模拟程序不是真实的。

1474
01:00:08.140 --> 01:00:11.340
And Morpheus says, your mind makes it real.
墨菲斯说，你的思想让它变得真实。

1475
01:00:11.640 --> 01:00:17.520
So if you die in the matrix, you die in real life because the body cannot live without the
所以如果你在母体中死去，你在现实中也会死，因为身体无法在没有思想的情况下存活，

1476
01:00:17.520 --> 01:00:21.020
mind unless you see through the matrix.
除非你看穿了母体。

1477
01:00:21.260 --> 01:00:22.900
Well, don't give away the end.
嘿，别剧透结局。

1478
01:00:24.680 --> 01:00:26.560
Pretend like you didn't hear that, everybody.
大家假装没听见。

1479
01:00:27.120 --> 01:00:33.140
All right, so Trinity is going to bring dinner to a sleeping Neo, and as she's exiting the
好了，崔妮蒂要给睡着的尼奥送晚餐，当她走出房间时，

1480
01:00:33.140 --> 01:00:35.160
room, Cypher is waiting outside for me.
赛弗在外面等着我。

1481
01:00:35.180 --> 01:00:36.280
You mean creepy Cypher?
你是说那个阴森的赛弗？

1482
01:00:36.340 --> 01:00:37.400
Yeah, so creepy.
对，太阴森了。

1483
01:00:37.580 --> 01:00:39.340
He's like, you never brought me dinner.
他说，你从来没给我送过晚餐。

1484
01:00:39.560 --> 01:00:39.900
Me.
我。

1485
01:00:41.060 --> 01:00:41.380
Yeah.
是啊。

1486
01:00:41.980 --> 01:00:43.860
And then, you know.
然后，你知道的。

1487
01:00:44.200 --> 01:00:46.780
Cypher is like, why isn't he taking him to meet the Oracle?
赛弗说，为什么他不带他去见先知？

1488
01:00:46.920 --> 01:00:47.600
All right, Cypher.
好吧，赛弗。

1489
01:00:47.740 --> 01:00:49.260
Methink thou does protest too much.
我觉得你抗议得太激烈了。

1490
01:00:49.340 --> 01:00:51.020
Why do you want him back out in the world so quick?
你为什么这么急着让他回到那个世界？

1491
01:00:51.020 --> 01:00:51.760
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

1492
01:00:52.020 --> 01:00:53.180
I know, exactly.
我知道，正是如此。

1493
01:00:53.620 --> 01:00:55.280
Well, listen, the training isn't done yet.
听着，训练还没结束呢。

1494
01:00:55.380 --> 01:00:59.520
They're not ready to go back into the matrix and meet the Oracle because Neo has more to
他们还没准备好回到母体去见先知，因为尼奥还有很多东西要学。

1495
01:00:59.520 --> 01:00:59.880
learn.
他必须学会任何人都有可能是特工。

1496
01:01:00.080 --> 01:01:03.320
He has to learn that anybody can be an agent.
没错，他们都是相互关联的。

1497
01:01:03.600 --> 01:01:04.980
Yeah, they're all connected.
是啊。

1498
01:01:05.280 --> 01:01:05.500
Yeah.
而且有太多人在母体里待了太久。

1499
01:01:05.780 --> 01:01:08.760
And so many people have been in the matrix for so long.
要么是他们还没准备好面对真相，要么是他们根本不想知道真相，然后

1500
01:01:08.860 --> 01:01:13.120
Either they're not ready to know the truth or they don't want to know the truth, and then
要么是他们根本不想知道真相，然后

1501
01:01:13.120 --> 01:01:14.420
they fight against it.
他们对抗着它。

1502
01:01:14.500 --> 01:01:16.100
And that means they fight against you.
这意味着他们也在对抗你。

1503
01:01:16.100 --> 01:01:20.100
This is proven to Neo because there's like all of these dudes walking around.
这一点对尼奥来说已经得到了证实，因为到处都是走来走去的人。

1504
01:01:20.240 --> 01:01:24.560
Everyone's wearing drab clothes in the simulation, and then this gorgeous gal in a red dress
在模拟世界里，每个人都穿着单调的衣服，然后那个穿着红裙子的迷人姑娘

1505
01:01:24.560 --> 01:01:27.660
walks by, and he turns his head, and boom, like that, she's an agent.
走了过去，他转过头，砰的一声，她就变成了特工。

1506
01:01:27.840 --> 01:01:29.140
Yeah, with a gun in his face.
没错，还用枪指着他的脸。

1507
01:01:29.220 --> 01:01:29.380
Yeah.
是啊。

1508
01:01:29.500 --> 01:01:30.580
Morpheus is like, freeze.
墨菲斯喊道，别动。

1509
01:01:30.980 --> 01:01:33.040
And everybody freezes except for the two of them.
除了他们俩，所有人都静止不动了。

1510
01:01:33.240 --> 01:01:35.100
But Tank is like, guys, we got to get you out.
但坦克说，伙计们，我们得让你们出来。

1511
01:01:35.180 --> 01:01:35.700
We're in trouble.
我们有麻烦了。

1512
01:01:35.920 --> 01:01:37.160
A squiddy is coming.
有个乌贼怪过来了。

1513
01:01:37.360 --> 01:01:40.840
In the real world, they got to get him out of the simulation because in the real world,
在现实世界中，他们必须让他离开模拟程序，因为在现实世界里，

1514
01:01:40.980 --> 01:01:42.460
there's this killing machine.
有个杀人机器。

1515
01:01:42.460 --> 01:01:46.080
It's a sentinel, and it's in hot pursuit of their ship, and they have to hide from it.
那是只哨兵，它正在紧追他们的飞船，他们必须躲开它。

1516
01:01:46.100 --> 01:01:48.580
They're like in the sewer system of the old cities.
他们就像是在旧城市的下水道系统里。

1517
01:01:49.040 --> 01:01:49.220
Yeah.
没错。

1518
01:01:49.420 --> 01:01:54.680
And they have this one defense against the squiddies, which is an electromagnetic pulse.
他们有一种防御乌贼怪的手段，那就是电磁脉冲。

1519
01:01:54.840 --> 01:01:55.100
Yeah.
没错。

1520
01:01:55.220 --> 01:02:00.300
Because they will disable all electric systems in the blast radius of this thing.
因为它会使爆炸半径内的所有电子系统瘫痪。

1521
01:02:00.400 --> 01:02:03.540
But like, you can't, you don't want to use it.
但是，你不能，你不想使用它。

1522
01:02:03.780 --> 01:02:05.160
It's last case scenario.
那是最后的手段。

1523
01:02:05.320 --> 01:02:05.460
Yeah.
没错。

1524
01:02:05.620 --> 01:02:06.900
It's like the red switch.
就像那个红色开关一样。

1525
01:02:07.040 --> 01:02:08.960
You don't, you know, want to do it.
你懂的，你不想去动它。

1526
01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:09.100
You don't.
你不想。

1527
01:02:09.280 --> 01:02:09.580
Mm-mm.
嗯。

1528
01:02:10.800 --> 01:02:15.060
Well, it's nighttime on the ship, and Neo is going to enter the room where Cypher is
好吧，飞船上是夜晚，尼奥走进赛弗正在

1529
01:02:15.060 --> 01:02:20.940
coding, and they're having a little, I guess, chit-chat.
写代码的房间，他们进行了一次，我想是闲聊吧。

1530
01:02:21.340 --> 01:02:21.740
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1531
01:02:22.200 --> 01:02:25.320
Cypher's like, oh, why didn't we take the blue pill?
赛弗说，噢，我们当初为什么不吃蓝色药丸呢？

1532
01:02:25.560 --> 01:02:27.740
And he's like drinking some homegrown booze.
他一边说着一边喝着自酿的酒。

1533
01:02:28.020 --> 01:02:30.600
And you can just tell he's not happy.
你能看得出来他不开心。

1534
01:02:30.800 --> 01:02:31.560
He wants out.
他想退出。

1535
01:02:31.560 --> 01:02:32.140
Yeah.
是啊。

1536
01:02:32.380 --> 01:02:39.280
Now we're going to cut to Cypher, like, sitting at a very nice dining table with some steak.
现在镜头切到赛弗，他坐在餐桌前，吃着牛排。

1537
01:02:39.280 --> 01:02:40.240
It's a steakhouse.
那是一家牛排馆。

1538
01:02:40.460 --> 01:02:43.260
It's clearly a flashback to what he was up to.
这显然是他过去经历的回忆。

1539
01:02:43.560 --> 01:02:43.880
Yeah.
没错。

1540
01:02:44.080 --> 01:02:45.460
Guess what he's up to?
猜猜他在干什么？

1541
01:02:45.500 --> 01:02:46.440
He's a mole.
他是内奸。

1542
01:02:46.620 --> 01:02:48.180
He's an inside man.
他是内应。

1543
01:02:48.340 --> 01:02:49.400
He's a double agent.
他是双面间谍。

1544
01:02:49.720 --> 01:02:49.920
Yeah.
没错。

1545
01:02:50.180 --> 01:02:53.420
He has made a deal to deliver Morpheus.
他已经达成交易，要把墨菲斯交出去。

1546
01:02:53.660 --> 01:02:59.600
The, like, agents want him to give the location of Zion so they can, like, destroy it.
那些特工想要他提供锡安的位置，这样他们就能摧毁它。

1547
01:02:59.660 --> 01:03:00.800
Yeah, so they can get in it.
没错，这样他们就能攻进去。

1548
01:03:00.800 --> 01:03:03.700
And he's like, I don't have that, but I'll give you Morpheus.
他说，我没有那个，但我可以把墨菲斯交给你们。

1549
01:03:03.920 --> 01:03:04.900
Morpheus has it.
墨菲斯有那个位置。

1550
01:03:05.600 --> 01:03:08.780
So he's agreed to deliver Morpheus to these guys.
所以他同意把墨菲斯交给这些人。

1551
01:03:08.780 --> 01:03:14.000
And then in exchange, they're going to, like, reinsert him into the Matrix.
作为交换，他们打算把他重新插回母体里。

1552
01:03:14.220 --> 01:03:14.520
How?
怎么做？

1553
01:03:14.660 --> 01:03:15.920
He's not thinking this through.
他根本没想清楚。

1554
01:03:16.100 --> 01:03:20.880
Well, he said, I don't want to remember anything, and I want to be someone important.
他说过，他不想记得任何事，而且想成为一个重要人物。

1555
01:03:21.240 --> 01:03:21.840
Someone rich.
一个有钱人。

1556
01:03:21.900 --> 01:03:22.260
Rich.
有钱。

1557
01:03:22.520 --> 01:03:23.300
Like an actor.
像个演员那样。

1558
01:03:23.580 --> 01:03:24.860
But he's eating the steak.
但他还在吃牛排呢。

1559
01:03:25.120 --> 01:03:27.880
I'm just curious how they reinsert him in a pot.
我只是好奇他们怎么把他重新塞回培养皿里。

1560
01:03:28.180 --> 01:03:29.620
How do they plug him back in?
他们怎么把他重新接回去？

1561
01:03:29.620 --> 01:03:30.920
And all the holes in his arMs.
还有他手臂上的那些孔洞。

1562
01:03:30.920 --> 01:03:32.160
How do they do all that again?
他们怎么能把这一切重来一遍？

1563
01:03:32.360 --> 01:03:33.480
I mean, I don't know.
我是说，我不知道。

1564
01:03:33.900 --> 01:03:35.560
Cypher, I don't think it's possible.
塞弗，我觉得这不可能。

1565
01:03:35.620 --> 01:03:36.820
And I think you're an idiot.
而且我觉得你是个白痴。

1566
01:03:37.360 --> 01:03:37.640
Yeah.
没错。

1567
01:03:37.840 --> 01:03:40.860
Do you think they're just going to kill him after they get the information they want?
你觉得他们在得到想要的信息后会杀了他吗？

1568
01:03:40.860 --> 01:03:41.880
One hundred percent.
百分之百会。

1569
01:03:42.140 --> 01:03:43.000
Okay, you're right.
好吧，你说得对。

1570
01:03:43.360 --> 01:03:47.680
Now we go from this beautiful steak to this disgusting ship slop.
现在我们从这美味的牛排转到了这恶心的飞船糊糊。

1571
01:03:47.860 --> 01:03:49.820
It's, like, white, gooey, gummy.
它看起来又白、又黏、又软。

1572
01:03:49.960 --> 01:03:54.840
It looks like a bunch of glue and some, like, shredded paper and water, maybe.
看起来就像一堆胶水，混着点碎纸和水之类的东西。

1573
01:03:55.020 --> 01:03:56.440
I ask again, why?
我再问一次，为什么？

1574
01:03:56.660 --> 01:03:57.240
I don't know.
我不知道。

1575
01:03:57.380 --> 01:03:58.260
Why is the food so crappy?
为什么食物这么难吃？

1576
01:03:58.500 --> 01:04:02.560
I mean, okay, let's say they can't make better food.
我是说，好吧，就算他们做不出更好的食物。

1577
01:04:02.660 --> 01:04:03.880
We know they can make pills.
我们知道他们能制造药丸。

1578
01:04:04.580 --> 01:04:07.860
Can they not just get the nutrients they need?
难道他们就不能直接摄取所需的营养吗？

1579
01:04:08.000 --> 01:04:09.500
Also, why is everything beige?
还有，为什么所有东西都是米色的？

1580
01:04:09.720 --> 01:04:11.100
They have dye for the pills.
他们都能给药丸染色。

1581
01:04:11.360 --> 01:04:13.120
Can't you have, like, a blue blouse?
难道就不能穿件蓝色的衬衫吗？

1582
01:04:13.580 --> 01:04:15.160
So you're back on the clothes.
你又扯到衣服上去了。

1583
01:04:15.340 --> 01:04:15.580
Sorry.
抱歉。

1584
01:04:15.700 --> 01:04:18.560
I'm like, why does the food look like vomit?
我只是在想，为什么食物看起来像呕吐物？

1585
01:04:18.740 --> 01:04:19.420
I don't know.
我不知道。

1586
01:04:19.740 --> 01:04:23.420
Well, Morpheus is going to say it's time to bring Neo to meet the Oracle.
好吧，墨菲斯要说该带尼奥去见先知了。

1587
01:04:23.720 --> 01:04:25.320
Here's the thing I was surprised about.
有一件事让我很惊讶。

1588
01:04:25.500 --> 01:04:25.720
What?
什么？

1589
01:04:25.720 --> 01:04:27.660
The entire crew goes.
全体船员都去了。

1590
01:04:28.060 --> 01:04:30.180
Everyone goes, except for Tank and Dozer.
除了坦克和多泽，所有人都去了。

1591
01:04:30.480 --> 01:04:30.800
Everyone.
所有人。

1592
01:04:30.800 --> 01:04:31.720
Well, I think backup.
嗯，我想是为了支援。

1593
01:04:32.120 --> 01:04:35.860
I mean, that shot of all of them, like, in that room.
我是说，他们所有人待在那个房间里的镜头。

1594
01:04:35.880 --> 01:04:36.320
It's cool.
很酷。

1595
01:04:36.420 --> 01:04:37.140
It's very cool.
非常酷。

1596
01:04:37.260 --> 01:04:39.840
It is such a beautiful tableau.
那真是一幅美丽的画面。

1597
01:04:39.900 --> 01:04:40.740
It really is.
确实如此。

1598
01:04:40.820 --> 01:04:44.220
And they're all in their, like, cool, slick outfits.
而且他们都穿着那种很酷、很时髦的行头。

1599
01:04:44.640 --> 01:04:45.700
Their kick-ass outfits.
他们那身帅气的行头。

1600
01:04:45.900 --> 01:04:46.060
Yep.
没错。

1601
01:04:46.380 --> 01:04:51.560
As everyone sort of leaves the hotel building that they've arrived in,
当每个人都从他们抵达的酒店大楼离开时，

1602
01:04:51.560 --> 01:04:55.360
and Cypher tosses his phone, his, like, cell phone, into a trash can.
赛弗把他的手机，那种手机，扔进了垃圾桶里。

1603
01:04:55.500 --> 01:04:57.880
And he, like, has made an outgoing call.
而且他刚才拨打了一个外线电话。

1604
01:04:57.900 --> 01:04:58.880
So it's, like, active.
所以电话是处于激活状态的。

1605
01:04:59.220 --> 01:04:59.480
Yeah.
没错。

1606
01:04:59.560 --> 01:05:01.600
I guess that's how they're going to trace them.
我想这就是他们追踪他们的方式。

1607
01:05:01.720 --> 01:05:01.920
Yeah.
是的。

1608
01:05:02.340 --> 01:05:03.800
Morpheus and Neo, they're there.
墨菲斯和尼奥，他们在那儿。

1609
01:05:03.900 --> 01:05:06.780
They're standing at the door where the Oracle lives.
他们正站在先知居住的门前。

1610
01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:08.740
I loved everything about the scene.
我喜欢这一幕的一切。

1611
01:05:08.900 --> 01:05:10.180
I loved her so much.
我太喜欢她了。

1612
01:05:10.320 --> 01:05:11.040
Well, of course.
嗯，当然。

1613
01:05:11.040 --> 01:05:11.820
We'll get to it.
我们待会儿会讲到。

1614
01:05:12.160 --> 01:05:12.560
Yes.
是的。

1615
01:05:12.820 --> 01:05:15.940
So Morpheus says, Neo, you have to enter the door.
墨菲斯对尼奥说，你必须走进那扇门。

1616
01:05:16.260 --> 01:05:16.960
I can't.
我做不到。

1617
01:05:17.040 --> 01:05:19.660
I can take you to the door, but I can't walk you through it.
我能带你到门口，但我不能陪你走进去。

1618
01:05:19.760 --> 01:05:20.160
Yes.
没错。

1619
01:05:21.960 --> 01:05:24.220
And a woman answers the door.
然后一个女人来开门了。

1620
01:05:25.120 --> 01:05:28.620
She takes him to kind of a waiting room of other potential the ones.
她把尼奥带到了一个候诊室，里面还有其他潜在的“救世主”。

1621
01:05:30.260 --> 01:05:33.480
There's a lot of children with very special powers.
有很多拥有特殊能力的孩子。

1622
01:05:33.700 --> 01:05:40.160
Which makes sense because Morpheus has told us they usually don't take a mind so late in life.
这说得通，因为墨菲斯告诉过我们，他们通常不会在这么大的年纪才去解救一个人的意识。

1623
01:05:40.580 --> 01:05:41.060
Yes.
是的。

1624
01:05:41.280 --> 01:05:41.460
Right?
对吧？

1625
01:05:41.940 --> 01:05:45.280
Well, I think that children's minds are more open.
嗯，我觉得孩子们的思想更开放。

1626
01:05:45.460 --> 01:05:47.800
So Neo's going to have a conversation with one of these kids.
接下来尼奥要和其中一个孩子交谈。

1627
01:05:47.800 --> 01:05:50.940
It's this kid has a spoon and he's like bending it with his mind.
那个孩子拿着一把勺子，正用意识把它弄弯。

1628
01:05:51.360 --> 01:05:54.600
And he's going to offer the spoon to Neo and say, why don't you bend it?
他要把勺子递给尼奥，说，你为什么不试着把它弄弯呢？

1629
01:05:54.800 --> 01:05:55.120
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1630
01:05:55.480 --> 01:05:56.680
I think we should hear it.
我觉得我们应该听听这段。

1631
01:05:56.680 --> 01:05:59.340
Do not try and bend the spoon.
不要试图去弯曲勺子。

1632
01:06:00.160 --> 01:06:01.600
That's impossible.
那是不可能的。

1633
01:06:03.420 --> 01:06:06.860
Instead, only try to realize the truth.
相反，试着去认清真相。

1634
01:06:07.580 --> 01:06:08.420
What truth?
什么真相？

1635
01:06:09.160 --> 01:06:10.720
There is no spoon.
根本没有勺子。

1636
01:06:13.480 --> 01:06:14.700
There is no spoon?
没有勺子？

1637
01:06:15.040 --> 01:06:18.400
Then you'll see that it is not the spoon that bends.
然后你就会明白，弯曲的不是勺子。

1638
01:06:18.560 --> 01:06:19.660
It is only yourself.
弯曲的只有你自己。

1639
01:06:19.660 --> 01:06:26.500
Well, this is so profound.
哇，这太深奥了。

1640
01:06:26.820 --> 01:06:28.680
The truth is there is no spoon.
真相就是根本没有勺子。

1641
01:06:29.100 --> 01:06:29.480
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1642
01:06:29.700 --> 01:06:32.960
Just like you're not breathing this air, none of this exists.
就像你并没有在呼吸这里的空气一样，这一切都不存在。

1643
01:06:33.760 --> 01:06:34.180
All right.
好吧。

1644
01:06:34.480 --> 01:06:36.980
Neo's going to meet the Oracle, Gloria Foster.
尼奥要去见先知了，由格洛丽亚·福斯特饰演。

1645
01:06:37.220 --> 01:06:38.700
Shout out to Gloria Foster.
向格洛丽亚·福斯特致敬。

1646
01:06:38.940 --> 01:06:42.120
She plays the Oracle in this Matrix and she is amazing.
她在《黑客帝国》里饰演先知，表现太棒了。

1647
01:06:42.560 --> 01:06:43.040
Amazing.
太棒了。

1648
01:06:43.280 --> 01:06:44.860
I have my favorite line from her.
我有她最让我喜欢的一句台词。

1649
01:06:45.820 --> 01:06:46.840
Oh, what is it?
哦，是什么？

1650
01:06:47.660 --> 01:06:49.020
You're cuter than I thought.
你比我想象中要可爱。

1651
01:06:49.240 --> 01:06:50.660
I can see why she likes you.
我明白她为什么喜欢你了。

1652
01:06:51.320 --> 01:06:52.120
Neo says, who?
尼奥说，谁？

1653
01:06:52.480 --> 01:06:54.820
And then she says, not too bright though.
然后她说，不过不太聪明。

1654
01:06:55.320 --> 01:06:55.920
I know.
我知道。

1655
01:06:56.000 --> 01:06:56.740
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

1656
01:06:58.860 --> 01:07:03.560
So she's making some cookies when he walks in.
所以当他走进去的时候，她正在烤饼干。

1657
01:07:03.740 --> 01:07:06.680
It's so like homey and like grandma-like.
感觉特别温馨，就像奶奶做的一样。

1658
01:07:06.920 --> 01:07:08.680
She says, I know why you're here.
她说，我知道你为什么来这儿。

1659
01:07:08.760 --> 01:07:09.900
You want to know if you're the one.
你想知道你是不是那个救世主。

1660
01:07:10.260 --> 01:07:10.500
Yeah.
没错。

1661
01:07:10.760 --> 01:07:16.300
And then she says, you know, being the one is kind of like being in love.
然后她说，你知道，成为救世主就像坠入爱河一样。

1662
01:07:16.840 --> 01:07:17.860
No one can tell you.
没人能告诉你。

1663
01:07:17.980 --> 01:07:18.860
You just know it.
你自己心里清楚。

1664
01:07:19.500 --> 01:07:23.700
But lady, I grabbed an audio clip because I want to hear Gloria Foster say it.
但是女士，我录了一段音频，因为我想听格洛丽亚·福斯特亲口说出来。

1665
01:07:23.940 --> 01:07:24.080
Okay.
好的。

1666
01:07:24.640 --> 01:07:26.340
I'm going to let you in on a little secret.
我要告诉你一个小秘密。

1667
01:07:26.820 --> 01:07:29.860
Being the one is just like being in love.
成为救世主就像坠入爱河一样。

1668
01:07:31.220 --> 01:07:32.960
No one can tell you you're in love.
没人能告诉你你是否坠入爱河了。

1669
01:07:33.060 --> 01:07:33.940
You just know it.
你自己心里清楚。

1670
01:07:34.360 --> 01:07:35.220
Through and through.
彻彻底底地清楚。

1671
01:07:37.060 --> 01:07:37.860
Balls to bones.
深入骨髓。

1672
01:07:40.120 --> 01:07:40.960
Balls to bones.
深入骨髓。

1673
01:07:41.000 --> 01:07:41.460
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1674
01:07:41.860 --> 01:07:42.240
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1675
01:07:42.340 --> 01:07:46.720
She sort of kind of goes through the motions of looking at his hands and his face like none
她装模作样地看了看他的手和脸，好像这些动作

1676
01:07:46.720 --> 01:07:48.380
of this stuff she needs to do, right?
她根本不需要做，对吧？

1677
01:07:48.560 --> 01:07:48.800
Yeah.
没错。

1678
01:07:48.800 --> 01:07:52.280
And she says, look, you've got the gift, but you're not the one.
然后她说，听着，你有天赋，但你不是救世主。

1679
01:07:52.440 --> 01:07:53.900
Maybe in your next life.
也许下辈子吧。

1680
01:07:54.020 --> 01:07:59.400
But she does say that Morpheus is going to sacrifice his own life to save Neo's because
但她确实说了，墨菲斯会为了救尼奥而牺牲自己的生命，因为

1681
01:07:59.400 --> 01:08:02.980
Morpheus so fully believes that Neo is the one.
墨菲斯坚信尼奥就是救世主。

1682
01:08:03.140 --> 01:08:07.100
And Neo will have to choose between his life and Morpheus's life.
而尼奥将不得不在自己的生命和墨菲斯的生命之间做出选择。

1683
01:08:07.320 --> 01:08:07.620
Yes.
是的。

1684
01:08:07.740 --> 01:08:09.240
But one of them will die.
但他们其中一人会死。

1685
01:08:09.440 --> 01:08:11.440
And she said, look, you've got a good heart.
她说，听着，你有一颗善良的心。

1686
01:08:11.440 --> 01:08:13.960
And I hate giving bad news to good people.
我不喜欢给好人带来坏消息。

1687
01:08:14.620 --> 01:08:16.600
But just, you know, eat your cookie.
但还是，你知道，吃你的饼干吧。

1688
01:08:16.800 --> 01:08:19.440
And as soon as you get outside, you're going to feel right as rain.
等你一走出去，你就会感觉好多了。

1689
01:08:19.920 --> 01:08:23.160
Every time I watch this movie, those cookies look so good to me.
每次我看这部电影，那些饼干看起来都特别诱人。

1690
01:08:23.320 --> 01:08:25.900
They look like an oatmeal chocolate chip cookie.
看起来像是燕麦巧克力豆饼干。

1691
01:08:26.100 --> 01:08:27.580
Is that why you brought cookies today?
这就是你今天带饼干来的原因吗？

1692
01:08:27.780 --> 01:08:28.700
Oh, my God.
天哪。

1693
01:08:28.700 --> 01:08:29.560
I thought about that.
我确实想过这个。

1694
01:08:29.560 --> 01:08:30.360
I brought cookies today.
我今天带了饼干。

1695
01:08:30.600 --> 01:08:30.960
I know.
我知道。

1696
01:08:31.200 --> 01:08:32.700
You normally don't bring cookies.
你平时不带饼干的。

1697
01:08:33.000 --> 01:08:34.260
I made cookies.
我做了饼干。

1698
01:08:34.260 --> 01:08:35.140
Wow.
哇。

1699
01:08:35.500 --> 01:08:36.600
Was that subconscious?
那是潜意识吗？

1700
01:08:36.880 --> 01:08:38.100
It must have been.
一定是。

1701
01:08:38.360 --> 01:08:42.040
Because the cookies looked so good in the movie when I watched it.
因为我看电影的时候，觉得那些饼干看起来太诱人了。

1702
01:08:42.160 --> 01:08:45.480
We also did not plan this or discuss this, but we both wore black.
我们也没商量过，也没提前计划，但我们俩都穿了黑色的衣服。

1703
01:08:46.660 --> 01:08:47.840
That's so funny.
太搞笑了。

1704
01:08:48.280 --> 01:08:49.320
Oh, my goodness.
天哪。

1705
01:08:50.480 --> 01:08:52.360
Neo walks out into the hallway.
尼奥走进了走廊。

1706
01:08:52.580 --> 01:08:53.480
Morpheus is there.
墨菲斯就在那儿。

1707
01:08:53.660 --> 01:08:54.480
And Neo says, listen.
尼奥说，听着。

1708
01:08:54.940 --> 01:08:56.460
Like, he doesn't want Neo to tell him.
就像是他不想让尼奥告诉他一样。

1709
01:08:56.560 --> 01:08:59.700
He's like, whatever the Oracle told him is for him alone.
他觉得先知告诉他的任何事都只属于他自己。

1710
01:09:00.080 --> 01:09:00.400
Yeah.
是啊。

1711
01:09:00.400 --> 01:09:04.320
Well, they're all, like, getting ready to go back to the phone.
他们都在准备回到电话那儿。

1712
01:09:04.540 --> 01:09:05.740
They're going to get their phone call.
他们要去接那个电话。

1713
01:09:05.840 --> 01:09:07.420
They're going to get out of the building.
他们要离开那栋大楼。

1714
01:09:07.680 --> 01:09:09.360
They're walking up the stairwell.
他们正走上楼梯间。

1715
01:09:09.460 --> 01:09:14.340
It's a really cool-looking stairwell in one of those busted buildings like they go into.
那是一个看起来很酷的楼梯间，就在他们进去的那种破旧建筑里。

1716
01:09:14.660 --> 01:09:14.920
Yep.
没错。

1717
01:09:15.180 --> 01:09:18.800
And Neo sees a black cat cross and then stutter and cross again.
然后尼奥看到一只黑猫走过，接着又卡顿了一下，又走了一次。

1718
01:09:18.800 --> 01:09:20.200
And he goes, oh, deja vu.
他说，噢，既视感。

1719
01:09:20.380 --> 01:09:21.240
Everyone stops.
所有人都停下了。

1720
01:09:21.460 --> 01:09:21.560
Yeah.
是啊。

1721
01:09:21.600 --> 01:09:23.060
Everyone's like, deja vu.
大家都说，既视感。

1722
01:09:23.260 --> 01:09:26.200
What it normally signifies is a glitch in the matrix.
这通常意味着母体出了故障。

1723
01:09:26.380 --> 01:09:28.320
Usually, they have changed something.
通常是因为他们改动了什么。

1724
01:09:28.800 --> 01:09:31.160
This is when they realize they're in a trap.
这时他们才意识到自己掉进陷阱了。

1725
01:09:31.420 --> 01:09:31.680
Yes.
没错。

1726
01:09:31.880 --> 01:09:35.440
They have cut off all of the, like, access to the building.
他们切断了所有通往大楼的出口。

1727
01:09:35.760 --> 01:09:37.840
When they open up the curtains, there's no window.
当他们拉开窗帘时，根本没有窗户。

1728
01:09:37.980 --> 01:09:38.920
It's just a brick wall.
只有一堵砖墙。

1729
01:09:39.120 --> 01:09:39.280
Yeah.
是啊。

1730
01:09:39.360 --> 01:09:41.320
They've changed the code of the room.
他们改动了房间的代码。

1731
01:09:41.480 --> 01:09:42.720
And they can't get phone calls.
他们没法打电话了。

1732
01:09:42.820 --> 01:09:43.440
They can't get out.
他们出不去了。

1733
01:09:43.600 --> 01:09:43.880
Mm-mm.
嗯。

1734
01:09:44.040 --> 01:09:46.840
By the way, to this day, if me or any of my friends say deja vu,
顺便说一下，直到今天，如果我和我的朋友们提到既视感，

1735
01:09:47.220 --> 01:09:49.220
like one of us say, it's a glitch in the matrix.
我们其中一个人就会说，这是母体故障了。

1736
01:09:49.820 --> 01:09:50.440
Oh, really?
噢，真的吗？

1737
01:09:50.620 --> 01:09:50.820
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1738
01:09:51.080 --> 01:09:54.140
My old group that we, like, hang out sometimes, my improv crowd.
我以前经常一起玩的朋友，就是我即兴表演圈子里的那些人。

1739
01:09:54.360 --> 01:09:54.520
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1740
01:09:54.880 --> 01:09:55.760
Glitch in the matrix.
母体故障。

1741
01:09:56.100 --> 01:09:56.800
Do you say that?
你会这么说吗？

1742
01:09:57.300 --> 01:09:57.460
I don't.
我不会。

1743
01:09:58.460 --> 01:10:00.740
I don't even think I say deja vu very much either.
我觉得我连既视感这个词都很少说。

1744
01:10:00.740 --> 01:10:01.840
I sometimes say deja vu.
我偶尔会说既视感。

1745
01:10:02.060 --> 01:10:04.360
Well, a big action sequence is coming up.
好吧，接下来是一场大型动作戏。

1746
01:10:04.500 --> 01:10:09.780
Oh, this scene is so hard for me to watch because Morpheus's team is just getting surrounded.
噢，这一幕我看得太难受了，因为墨菲斯的团队正被团团包围。

1747
01:10:10.000 --> 01:10:11.040
They go and they hide.
他们去躲了起来。

1748
01:10:11.200 --> 01:10:14.100
Tank helps them find this hole inside the building.
坦克帮他们找到了大楼里的一个洞。

1749
01:10:14.240 --> 01:10:16.540
Like, they're in the walls where the plumbing is, right?
就像是他们躲在管道所在的墙壁里，对吧？

1750
01:10:16.800 --> 01:10:16.980
Yeah.
是啊。

1751
01:10:16.980 --> 01:10:18.840
And they're scooching down quietly.
他们正悄悄地溜下去。

1752
01:10:19.100 --> 01:10:21.060
And the agents are, like, looking for them.
特工们好像正在搜寻他们。

1753
01:10:21.340 --> 01:10:24.120
And then Cypher coughs in the wall.
然后赛弗在墙里咳嗽了一声。

1754
01:10:24.900 --> 01:10:25.120
Yeah.
是啊。

1755
01:10:25.120 --> 01:10:26.660
Did he mean to do it?
他是故意的吗？

1756
01:10:26.740 --> 01:10:29.440
Or did he just really have a lot of drywall all over him?
还是因为他身上沾了太多干墙灰？

1757
01:10:29.540 --> 01:10:32.000
I mean, to be fair, I wonder the same thing.
我是说，平心而论，我也在想这个问题。

1758
01:10:32.160 --> 01:10:36.140
He does get a face full of, like, dust in his face.
他的脸上确实被糊了一脸灰尘。

1759
01:10:36.140 --> 01:10:36.480
He does.
确实。

1760
01:10:36.500 --> 01:10:36.860
He does.
确实。

1761
01:10:37.000 --> 01:10:38.580
But come on, Cypher.
但拜托，赛弗。

1762
01:10:38.740 --> 01:10:42.620
Well, the agents now know where they are, and they just start firing into the wall.
好吧，特工们现在知道他们在哪里了，于是开始对着墙壁开火。

1763
01:10:43.020 --> 01:10:45.700
And Morpheus is determined to protect his team.
墨菲斯决心保护他的团队。

1764
01:10:45.700 --> 01:10:51.940
So he throws himself through this hole in the wall on top of one of the agents and begins
所以他穿过墙上的洞扑向其中一名特工，并开始

1765
01:10:51.940 --> 01:10:52.660
to fight him.
与他搏斗。

1766
01:10:53.040 --> 01:10:53.220
Yeah.
是啊。

1767
01:10:53.680 --> 01:10:57.720
In the midst of all this chaos, Cypher has gotten out and called Tank and said, I need
在这片混乱中，赛弗已经逃了出来，并打电话给坦克说，我需要

1768
01:10:57.720 --> 01:10:58.200
to come in.
回去。

1769
01:10:58.320 --> 01:11:03.300
And as soon as he gets in there, he then kills Dozer and fires at Tank.
他一进去，就杀死了多泽，并向坦克开火。

1770
01:11:03.500 --> 01:11:09.980
And now Cypher, in the real world, is in control and can just pull people's plugs and
现在，在现实世界中，赛弗掌控了一切，他可以直接拔掉人们的插头，

1771
01:11:09.980 --> 01:11:10.640
they'll die.
他们就会死。

1772
01:11:11.000 --> 01:11:12.340
Yes, exactly.
没错，正是这样。

1773
01:11:12.340 --> 01:11:17.320
And he walks around, he's talking to Trinity, and he's like, say goodbye to Apoc.
他走来走去，跟崔妮蒂说话，他说，跟阿波克告别吧。

1774
01:11:17.520 --> 01:11:20.700
And then he says, do you have anything you want to say to Switch?
然后他说，你有什么话想对斯威奇说吗？

1775
01:11:20.940 --> 01:11:24.160
And this part just breaks me every time I watch it.
每次看到这一段，我都会心碎。

1776
01:11:24.320 --> 01:11:29.460
Trinity looks at Switch and she says, not like this, as she's holding Apoc in her arMs.
崔妮蒂看着斯威奇，怀里抱着阿波克，她说，别这样。

